{"id":"windy","title":{"en":"Fresh breeze","de":"Frische Brise"},"description":{"en":"Beaufort 5, 8 m/s at 10 m (power-law profile, exponent 0.22). Drag F = 0.5 rho cd A v^2 with rho 1.25 kg/m3, cd 0.35 (Vogel reconfiguration at moderate speed) and the frontal area pi ry 0.9 rx of each foliage mass (11.7 to 18.9 m2): about 1.8 kN in total. The crown leans downwind, progressively more towards the tips.","de":"Beaufort 5, 8 m/s in 10 m Höhe (Potenzprofil, Exponent 0,22). Widerstand F = 0,5 rho cd A v^2 mit rho 1,25 kg/m3, cd 0,35 (Vogel-Umformung bei mäßiger Geschwindigkeit) und der Anströmfläche pi ry 0,9 rx jeder Laubmasse (11,7 bis 18,9 m2): insgesamt etwa 1,8 kN. Die Krone neigt sich in Windrichtung, zu den Spitzen hin zunehmend."},"bones":{"trunk":{"angleDeg":-1},"trunk-upper":{"angleDeg":-1.4},"leader":{"angleDeg":-2},"leader-top":{"angleDeg":-3},"limb-w-low":{"angleDeg":-2},"limb-e-low":{"angleDeg":-2},"limb-w-mid":{"angleDeg":-2},"limb-e-mid":{"angleDeg":-2},"br-w-low":{"angleDeg":-3.5},"br-e-low":{"angleDeg":-3.5},"br-w-mid":{"angleDeg":-3.5},"br-e-mid":{"angleDeg":-3.5},"br-leader-w":{"angleDeg":-3.5},"br-leader-e":{"angleDeg":-3.5},"br-low-w-up":{"angleDeg":-3},"br-low-e-up":{"angleDeg":-3},"fol-w-low":{"angleDeg":-7},"fol-e-low":{"angleDeg":-7},"fol-w-mid":{"angleDeg":-7},"fol-e-mid":{"angleDeg":-7},"fol-leader-w":{"angleDeg":-7},"fol-leader-e":{"angleDeg":-7},"fol-top":{"angleDeg":-7},"fol-core":{"angleDeg":-7}},"ground":"authored","contacts":[],"thermal":{"operating":{},"emitters":{"transpiration-top":1,"transpiration-w":1,"transpiration-e":1}},"loads":[
