{"id":"wet-snow","title":{"en":"Wet autumn snow on the foliage","de":"Nasser Herbstschnee im Laub"},"description":{"en":"An early snowfall on a tree still in leaf: 10 kg/m2 of wet snow on the plan area pi 0.9 rx^2 of every foliage mass (1.5 to 2.5 kN each) bends limbs and branches down; wind is calm. Load estimate follows the order of magnitude of EN 1991-1-3, not a code value.","de":"Früher Schneefall auf einen noch belaubten Baum: 10 kg/m2 Nassschnee auf der Grundrissfläche pi 0,9 rx^2 jeder Laubmasse (je 1,5 bis 2,5 kN) biegen Äste und Zweige nach unten; Windstille. Die Lastannahme folgt der Größenordnung von EN 1991-1-3, ist aber kein Normwert."},"bones":{"limb-w-low":{"angleDeg":3},"limb-e-low":{"angleDeg":-3},"limb-w-mid":{"angleDeg":4},"limb-e-mid":{"angleDeg":-4},"br-w-low":{"angleDeg":6},"br-e-low":{"angleDeg":-6},"br-w-mid":{"angleDeg":6},"br-e-mid":{"angleDeg":-6},"br-leader-w":{"angleDeg":5},"br-leader-e":{"angleDeg":-5},"br-low-w-up":{"angleDeg":5},"br-low-e-up":{"angleDeg":-5},"fol-w-low":{"angleDeg":-8},"fol-e-low":{"angleDeg":8},"fol-w-mid":{"angleDeg":-8},"fol-e-mid":{"angleDeg":8},"fol-leader-w":{"angleDeg":6},"fol-leader-e":{"angleDeg":-6}},"ground":"authored","contacts":[],"thermal":{"operating":{},"emitters":{"transpiration-top":0,"transpiration-w":0,"transpiration-e":0}},"loads":[
