{"id":"diurnal-transpiration","title":{"en":"Day of transpiration","de":"Transpirationstag"},"description":{"en":"A 24 h cycle compressed to 24 s (1 s = 1 h, 00:00 to 24:00), calm weather. Leaf and bark temperatures are keyed from the engine's own energy balance at the hourly solar irradiance (0 to 800 W/m2); the sunlit fraction of the crown and the transpiration plume strength follow the sun, stomata nearly closed at night.","de":"Ein 24-h-Zyklus auf 24 s gerafft (1 s = 1 h, 00:00 bis 24:00) bei ruhigem Wetter. Blatt- und Rindentemperaturen sind aus der Energiebilanz der Engine bei der stündlichen Einstrahlung (0 bis 800 W/m2) abgeleitet; der besonnte Kronenanteil und die Stärke der Transpirationsfahne folgen der Sonne, nachts sind die Stomata fast geschlossen."},"durationS":24,"fps":10,"loop":true,"rootMotion":"none","keys":[{"t":0,"pose":"calm","ease":"smooth"},{"t":12,"pose":"calm","ease":"smooth"},{"t":24,"pose":"calm","ease":"smooth"}],"contacts":[],"phases":[{"id":"night","fromS":0,"toS":6,"title":{"en":"Night","de":"Nacht"}},{"id":"morning","fromS":6,"toS":12,"title":{"en":"Morning to noon","de":"Morgen bis Mittag"}},{"id":"afternoon","fromS":12,"toS":18,"title":{"en":"Afternoon","de":"Nachmittag"}},{"id":"evening","fromS":18,"toS":24,"title":{"en":"Evening and night","de":"Abend und Nacht"}}],"events":[{"t":6,"kind":"thermal","title":{"en":"Sunrise","de":"Sonnenaufgang"}},{"t":12,"kind":"thermal","title":{"en":"Solar noon, peak transpiration","de":"Sonnenhöchststand, maximale Transpiration"}},{"t":18,"kind":"thermal","title":{"en":"Sunset","de":"Sonnenuntergang"}}],"tracks":[
